 brief:"Friday 16:40 UTC. GuardDuty raises UnauthorizedAccess:IAMUser/InstanceCredentialExfiltration.OutsideAWS for the role on the image service's EC2 instances. Use CloudTrail (with S3 data events on for the exports bucket) to work out what happened, then decide how to respond. Everything you learned in the 12 modules applies.",
